From a98007a9ab9dde58211e6ead810eb4dcf5b81ece Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 00:36:47 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 04/24] power: supply: add a read-only QGauge battery monitor
 and use it on gta4l

Report battery voltage, current, an estimated charge level and a
charging state from the PMI632 QGauge block. The driver never writes
to the PMIC. The level is estimated from the open circuit voltage with
the table of the stock battery profile. Compile-tested only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016AirPAcjr6JyfsKizshE8B
